# test_data: track Azure reference JSON + testfiles binaries (override global *.json / test_data binary rules above)
!test_data/Azure/
!test_data/Azure/**/
!test_data/Azure/**/*.json
!test_data/testfiles/
!test_data/testfiles/**/
!test_data/testfiles/**/*.pdf
